# SMTP Configuration for sending emails
# ── SMTP / Email (Nodemailer + Gmail) ────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: EMAIL_PASSWORD must be a Gmail App Password, NOT your regular Gmail password.
# Steps to get a valid App Password:

#   1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security → enable 2-Step Verification
#   2. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#   3. Select "Mail" + "Other" → name it "Chakra ERP" → click Generate
#   4. Copy the 16-char password shown and paste it below (no spaces)
#   5. Restart the backend server after updating
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_PORT=587
EMAIL_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@yourdomain.com
SMTP_FROM_NAME=Sri Chakra Industries